        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/game-pass-negative-stonks.webp?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Xbox could be planning another major shake-up of its Game Pass subscription service, this time removing key benefits the service is known for. That's according to a new leak from ResetEra user Slayven, who <a href=\"https://www.resetera.com/threads/rumor-big-changes-to-gamepass-including-a-free-cheaper-tier-with-ads.1313263/\">in 2025 revealed Microsoft's plans to raise Game Pass prices</a> and change tier offerings, <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/microsoft-increases-price-of-xbox-game-pass-ultimate-despite-record-subscription-profits-last-year\">some of which turned out to be true</a>.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/xbox-game-pass-big-changes-2027-rumour-microsoft-responds\">Read more</a></p>",
