        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/diablo-4-season-of-hells-legacy-keyart-1.jpeg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>The launch of <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/diablo-iv\">Diablo 4</a>'s Season of Hell's Legacy got off to a rough start. The anticipated season <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/diablo-4-season-of-hells-legacy-switch-2-amazon-class\">was announced at BlizzCon over the weekend to arrive alongside a 30th anniversary celebration of the Diablo franchise</a>. And though Season of Hell's Legacy eventually went live, it did so several hours after it was supposed to.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/diablo-4-season-of-hells-legacy-30th-anniversary-delayed\">Read more</a></p>",
